@startuml
' Confirmation input handling; command validation and model deletion details are omitted.
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 160

actor User
participant ":BusyNotFree" as App
participant ":CommandHandler" as CH
participant ":Ui" as UI

User -> App : valid deletion request
App -> CH : execute(request)
CH -> CH : validate and retain pending selection
CH -> UI : show deletion confirmation
CH --> App : false

note over App, CH
  While confirmation is pending, normal command parsing
  and standalone save handling are bypassed.
end note

loop zero or more invalid confirmation answers
  User -> App : other input, including help / save / exit
  App -> CH : execute(input)
  CH -> UI : show error and repeat confirmation
  CH --> App : false
end

alt user confirms
  User -> App : yes
  App -> CH : execute("yes")
  CH -> CH : handleDeletionConfirmation("yes")
  note right of CH
    Model interactions are omitted here.
    See ProjectDeletionSequenceDiagram.
  end note
  CH -> UI : show deletion result
  CH --> App : false
else user cancels
  User -> App : no
  App -> CH : execute("no")
  CH -> CH : cancelPendingDeletion()
  CH -> UI : show cancellation message
  CH --> App : false
else input ends
  User -> App : end of input
  App -> CH : cancelPendingDeletion()
  CH -> UI : show cancellation message
  App -> App : attempt save and return
end
@enduml
